 ......... Let `?(routineTypeDefIR_b')` be routineTypeDefIR'?{routineTypeDefIR' <- routineTypeDefIR'?}
for each `routineTypeDefIR'?` in `routineTypeDefIR'?*`

......... If (RoutineTypeDef_alpha: routineTypeDefIR_a' ~~ routineTypeDefIR_b')*{routineTypeDefIR_a' <- routineTypeDefIR_a'*, routineTypeDefIR_b' <- routineTypeDefIR_b'*} holds, then

.......... The relation holds

